{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e10-scene-12",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "黄金一班再玩一把  (One More Round for the Golden Class)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美",
    "bianbian": "边边"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Gathering her fellow debut contestants over hotpot nine years after their legendary singing competition, Xin Huimei dares the entire 'Golden Class' to reunite with her on Twelve Singers—giving Bianbian's Lutiao newsroom a blockbuster story. Listen to the Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们现在都是大牌唱将，约一次太难了，都太火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "叫你们来是有一个好玩的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "十二歌王要改版了，他们约我去参加竞唱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我一个人去没意思，你们要不要一块儿，就像当年咱们那次比赛一样再玩一把？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我知道当年我拿总冠军，你们心里没一个服气的，还敢再战吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "没这点事，还叫娱乐圈吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来吧，干杯！十二歌王，加油！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "九年前的著名歌手大赛梦想之声，打造出了流行乐坛的黄金一班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "如今传出以辛惠美为首的黄金一班五位唱将，一起加盟十二歌王。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "很多歌迷听到这个消息无比振奋，观众对十二歌王的期待值正在飙升。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "写完稿子再睡好不好？大家加把劲！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "今天的稿子铺满，全网推送！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们现在都是大牌唱将，约一次太难了，都太火。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of you are top-tier vocal stars now — getting everyone together once is so hard because you're all so popular.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "叫你们来是有一个好玩的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I invited you all tonight because I have something fun to propose.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "十二歌王要改版了，他们约我去参加竞唱。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Twelve Singers is revamping its format, and they invited me to compete.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我一个人去没意思，你们要不要一块儿，就像当年咱们那次比赛一样再玩一把？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Going by myself would be boring — want to join in together and have one more round just like our contest nine years ago?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我知道当年我拿总冠军，你们心里没一个服气的，还敢再战吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know none of you were convinced inside when I won the championship back then — dare to battle me again?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "没这点事，还叫娱乐圈吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Without a little gossip like that, could you even call it show business?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来吧，干杯！十二歌王，加油！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Come on, cheers! Twelve Singers, let's go!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "九年前的著名歌手大赛梦想之声，打造出了流行乐坛的黄金一班。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Nine years ago, the famed singing competition Voice of Dreams forged pop music's legendary Golden Class.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "如今传出以辛惠美为首的黄金一班五位唱将，一起加盟十二歌王。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now word has broken that five powerhouse vocalists of the Golden Class led by Xin Huimei are joining Twelve Singers together.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "很多歌迷听到这个消息无比振奋，观众对十二歌王的期待值正在飙升。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Countless music fans are thrilled by the news, and audience anticipation for Twelve Singers is skyrocketing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "写完稿子再睡好不好？大家加把劲！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Finish writing your articles before sleeping, alright? Keep pushing, everyone!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "今天的稿子铺满，全网推送！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Flood every channel with today's story and push it across the entire web!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "你们现在都是大牌唱将，约一次太难了，都太火。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "叫你们来是有一个好玩的事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "十二歌王要改版了，他们约我去参加竞唱。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我一个人去没意思，你们要不要一块儿，就像当年咱们那次比赛一样再玩一把？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我知道当年我拿总冠军，你们心里没一个服气的，还敢再战吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "没这点事，还叫娱乐圈吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "来吧，干杯！十二歌王，加油！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "九年前的著名歌手大赛梦想之声，打造出了流行乐坛的黄金一班。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "如今传出以辛惠美为首的黄金一班五位唱将，一起加盟十二歌王。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "很多歌迷听到这个消息无比振奋，观众对十二歌王的期待值正在飙升。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "写完稿子再睡好不好？大家加把劲！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "今天的稿子铺满，全网推送！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "As Xin Huimei and her old rivals clink glasses to Twelve Singers, Bianbian's reporters work through the night pushing the reunion announcement across the internet. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bianbian",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
